      "conventions_hint": "This is a Claude Code marketplace CATALOG, not application code. `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` is GENERATED by `scripts/regen.py` and must never be hand-edited; it must stay canonically formatted (`json.dumps(indent=2)` + trailing newline \u2014 CI enforces this). Plugin `name`s must be unique across the catalog. Each plugin `source` is either `{source: github, repo}` for a repo-root plugin or `{source: git-subdir, url, path}` for a monorepo subpackage \u2014 the `github` source type has no `path` field. `metadata.version` is the catalog's own version (bumped only by release-please); per-plugin `version`s mirror their upstream source repos and are carried over by regen.py. Scrutinize any change to scripts/regen.py or scripts/validate.py, and any plugin source pointing at an unexpected repo."
